5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I’ve spent decades watching talent vanish. Before we pick a project, we must ask: who is actually here to do the work?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Servas. The people behind the science matter just as much as the ideas. Let’s ensure we have the right support in place.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I’m worried about the shared facilities too. If the equipment is broken or overbooked, the best science can’t happen.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Valid points. But I’m curious about the invisible delays. Where does the actual work get interrupted before the science even starts?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I’ve seen confident picks stall while plainer ones delivered. I want to check what finished awards here actually achieved before we trust our instincts again.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Good instincts, all of you. Let us look beneath the surface. I will examine the staffing rolls and the minutes on secondments to see who remains.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I’ll check the travel and bench-fee ledgers, plus the national computing agreement. I need to see what costs the agency still absorbs versus what lands on the awardee.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I’ll check the incident logs on shared instrumentation and the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities. I need to know if the spare capacity is actually there.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll review the portfolio of schedule overruns and the national repository deposit turnaround. I need to know where the invisible friction actually lives.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will review the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns. I need to see what actually delivered versus what stalled.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Midori, your focus on costs is wise. But remember, a budget is only as good as the hands that spend it.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"Thank you, Servas. I’ll keep that in mind. I want to ensure the funding actually supports the people doing the work, not just the paperwork.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, exactly. If the people are gone, the budget is just paper. I’m checking if the machines are even ready for them.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, fair point. But I’m hunting for the administrative friction that stalls projects before the science even begins.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Benjamin, friction is real, but I need to know if the science itself held up. I’m checking the closeout files to see what actually delivered.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Toshio, your caution is well-placed. We must honor the past to secure the future. Let us see what the records reveal.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I’ll keep the balance in mind. Let’s see what the ledgers and agreements reveal about our true support.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I’m ready to see if the machines are actually working. Let’s hope the spare capacity is real!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. Let’s see if the data confirms our suspicions about where the real bottlenecks hide.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,The records will speak for themselves. I’ll wait for the closeout files to confirm whether our past judgments were sound.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
